Error [jet.ProhibitedEffectReached]: `ffi_c_library_grant_does_not_cover_another_library::run` reaches the `FFI.C("m")` effect, which the package's `authority: { allow: […] }` row doesn't list
  --> tests/ui/ffi_c_library_grant_does_not_cover_another_library.jet:13:1
    |
 13 | run: fn() {
    | ^^^
 Why: A written `allow` row is a ceiling: the package's code and every call it makes may use only the listed effects and the floor every program holds (`IO`, `Mem.Alloc`, `Exec.Args`)
 Fix: Add `FFI.C("m")` to `authority.allow`, or remove the call that reaches it
 Denial: invocation
 Call chain: ffi_c_library_grant_does_not_cover_another_library::run
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0749
